<h3><u>Ya Imam-e-Reza</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><p dir=""ltr"">Ya Imame Reza x 4</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">Aye garibul watan ya Imame Reza x 2</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">Warise bekafan ya Imame Reza.</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">Aye garibul watan ya Imame Reza x 2</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">1. Haye sitam zeher ka dono sehkar gaye<br />
Bilyaqeen laadle dono zehra ke the<br />
Ek imame hasan ya Imame Reza</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">2. Shahe karbobala se ye nisbat teri<br />
Unke laashe pe bhi tere laashe pe bhi<br />
Rona paayi behen ya imame Reza</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">3. Tere baba ka tabut uthna saka<br />
Pool pe baghdad ke laasha rakkha raha<br />
Tha kafan payraahan ya imame Reza</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">4. Jo chubhan tere seene me thi zeher ki<br />
Abbhi mehsoos karte hai wo maatami<br />
Apne dil me chubhan ya imame Reza</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">5. Aye bine sayyada aye bine murtaza<br />
Mushkilo me hame hai tera aasra<br />
Badshahe zaman ya imame Reza</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">6. Haqqe ajdaad ko tujse chhina gaya<br />
Haye madina tera tujse chhudwa diya<br />
Aye aseere mahan ya Imame Reza</p>

<p>7. Jaaye salmaano meesum khorasan me<br />
Tere rauze pe jaaker ye nauha padhe<br />
Dede izne sukhan ya imame Reza</p>
</p>